  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 2
  storyText: "- This morning, the university loudspeakers crackled to life for the
    first time since everything went down. \\n- An emergency evacuation notice was
    broadcasted \u2014 all students must leave the dorms and head to the stadium
    for pickup. But after what we saw yesterday, leaving our room feels like a death
    sentence. \\n - So we decided to stay put, barricade the door, and pray they
    don't come breaking down our floor next.\r"
